{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "74c121f6-5065-81a5-9063-cbeeb94d817c",
  "created_at": "2025-12-21T11:14:04-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Hector Quintero",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:05:33-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:05:42-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Lorraine. Thank you for answering. I know is Sunday, City Hall is closed, so I call the storm line. I hope this is the right one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:06:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is the right one. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:06:08-05:00",
      "duration": 29,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. There is a grate at the curb, the storm drain, and it has sunk down. Is lower than the street now, like a little bowl around it. So the water, when it rains, it goes everywhere but down the grate."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:06:37-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the grate itself has sunk below the level of the pavement."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:06:47-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. The grate is lower, but the water goes around, past it. It did this with the soaker Wednesday and Thursday, three days ago. Still some puddle now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:07:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And what's the address where this is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:07:15-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fifty-eight Chapel Street. Is up on the Historic Hill. The drain is at the curb right in front of my house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:07:30-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fifty-eight Chapel Street, in front of the house. Let me write that down. Is the water getting into anything, your house or a yard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:07:47-05:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not my house, no. But the water, it runs down the curb toward my neighbor. They have a garage, low, and the water is moving toward the garage door. Wednesday it came close, maybe one meter from the door."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:08:14-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so it's heading toward the neighbor's garage. Did it get inside?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:08:23-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't think so. I look Thursday night, it stopped before the door. But if we have more rain, I think it goes in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:08:40-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. And is the grate blocked with leaves or debris, or is it just the sinking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:08:52-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Little bit of leaves on top, but is mostly the sinking. I clean the leaves with a rake Friday. The grate is still low. The pavement around, it is like cracked also."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:09:15-05:00",
      "duration": 31,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the road around the grate has cracked and settled. That's helpful. Let me read back what I have: sunken storm drain grate at the curb in front of fifty-eight Chapel Street, water bypassing it and running toward the neighbor's garage. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:09:46-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is right. You say it very good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:09:53-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And a number for you, in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:10:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-five-two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:10:07-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-five-two. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:10:12-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hector Quintero. Q-U-I-N-T-E-R-O."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:10:15-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Quintero. I'll put this in as a repair request for the drain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:10:26-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Lorraine, one question. The crews, they work on weekends? Because if rain comes again, I worry is too late by Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:10:42-05:00",
      "duration": 31,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sometimes they do, mostly for emergencies. A sunken grate with no water in a building would normally go in the regular queue, so I can't promise a weekend visit. But I'll note that water is heading toward a garage, so they know it's a concern."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:11:13-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please put that. The garage. That is the important part."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:11:21-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I have it noted. If the water does start going into the garage, call back right away and tell whoever answers that it's actively flooding. That changes how they look at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:11:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I will do that. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:11:50-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is there a forecast rain coming that you know of?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:11:58-05:00",
      "duration": 31,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't know exactly. I look on the phone later. Excuse me, one second, I am waiting for a message, I sell a bicycle on the internet this morning and the buyer, he is supposed to write me back. [pause] No, nothing yet. Sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:12:29-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:12:35-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. So, what happens now with my report?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:12:42-05:00",
      "duration": 28,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It goes to the Public Works crew supervisors. Someone will go out and look at the grate and the pavement around it, and decide what kind of repair it needs. Sometimes it's a quick reset, sometimes it needs paving work."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:13:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. And somebody calls me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:13:15-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Possibly, if they need more information. Otherwise you'd just see the crew out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:13:25-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is good. I stay near the house today, so if they come, I show them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:13:37-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Anything else you wanted to report, Mr. Quintero?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:13:44-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Just the grate. You were very patient with me. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:13:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good Sunday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:14:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Lorraine. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
